# The playground API's routes, with a body that works. The API panel sends these (so do VS Code's
# REST Client and JetBrains' HTTP Client), and paths are relative to the API, which listens on the
# port it prints (the workspace's API_PORT). The Vite dev server forwards /v1 to it, so the same
# paths also work against WEB_PORT.
#
# Sent top to bottom after npm run api:reset, each request gets what its > lines say: the status, a
# header, or a value at a JSON path. "# @name created" names a request, so a later one can use
# {{created.response.body.$.id}}.

### The API is up
GET /healthz

> status 200
> json $ == {"status": "ok"}

### Every item
GET /v1/items

> status 200
> json $ == $len:5
> json $[0] == {"id": 1, "title": "Learn JSX", "done": true}

### Items whose title contains "test"
GET /v1/items?q=test

> status 200
> json $[*].id == [5]

### Items not done yet
GET /v1/items?done=false

> status 200
> json $[*].id == [3, 4, 5]

### Add an item: the title is trimmed, and done starts false
# @name created
POST /v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "  Try useOptimistic  "}

> status 201
> header Location ~ /v1/items/\d+$
> json $ == {"id": 6, "title": "Try useOptimistic", "done": false, "created_at": "2026-10-01T09:00:00Z"}

### The item just added
GET /v1/items/{{created.response.body.$.id}}

> status 200
> json $.title == "Try useOptimistic"

### Mark it done
PATCH /v1/items/{{created.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"done": true}

> status 200
> json $.done == true

### An empty title: 422, and errors says which field
POST /v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "   "}

> status 422
> header Content-Type ~ ^application/problem\+json
> json $.errors.title == "must be 1 to 120 characters"

### An item that doesn't exist: 404
GET /v1/items/999

> status 404

### Delete it
DELETE /v1/items/{{created.response.body.$.id}}

> status 204

### See exactly what a request sent
POST /v1/echo?page=2
Content-Type: application/json

{"hello": "playground"}

> status 200
> json $ == {"method": "POST", "path": "/echo", "query": {"page": "2"}, "body": {"hello": "playground"}}

### Slow on purpose: answers after 1.5 seconds
GET /v1/items
X-HU-Delay: 1500

> status 200

### Failing on purpose: answers 503
GET /v1/items
X-HU-Fail: 503

> status 503
> json $.status == 503

### Back to the 5 seed items (outside /v1, for checks and resets)
POST /_hu/reset

> status 204
